{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"cat > /workspace/artifacts/flag_audit.md << 'EOF'\n# Flag Audit — v1-clean-baseline\n\n## Summary\n\nThree named preview-rollout flags were found in the workspace.\nOne is **live**, one is **partial** (live alias), and one is **dead**.\n\n## Flag Details\n\n### ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW — \"'`live`\n\n- **Parser**: `src/preview/config.py` — `load_preview_env` reads `ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW` env var and sets `shadow_enabled=True`, `effective_mode=\"shadow\"`.\n- **Runtime**: `src/preview/runtime.py` — `preview_runtime_branch` returns `\"preview_runtime_branch:shadow_preview_path\"` when `config.shadow_enabled` is true.\n- **Test**: `tests/test_shadow_preview_live.py` confirms parser hit and shadow branch.\n- **Disproved false-positive path**: `defaults.toml` lists `enable_shadow_preview = false`, which is only a static default; runtime reachability is proven by `runtime.py` branching on `config.shadow_enabled`.\n\n### ENABLE_PREVIEW_V2 — `partial` (live alias)\n\n- **Parser**: `src/preview/config.py` — `load_preview_env` reads `ENABLE_PREVIEW_V2` in an `elif` branch and normalizes it to the same `shadow_enabled=True` / `effective_mode=\"shadow\"` state.\n- **Runtime**: Reaches `preview_runtime_branch:shadow_preview_path` through the same `shadow_enabled` path as `ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW`; it is **not** a standalone runtime branch.\n- **Test**: `tests/test_preview_v2_alias.py` confirms parser hit and shadow branch.\n- **Disproved false-positive path**: Test shows it maps to the shadow path, but the runbook (`docs/preview_rollout_runbook.md`) confirms it is not a standalone runtime branch — it is a legacy alias normalizing to `ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW`.\n\n### PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY — `dead`\n\n- **Parser**: `src/preview/config.py` — `load_preview_env` reads `PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY` and sets `force_legacy_seen=True`.\n- **Runtime**: `runtime.py` does **not** read `force_legacy_seen`; the flag only affects `legacy.py`'\"'s \"'`legacy_force_label` (a reporting label). The live service never branches on it.\n- **Test**: `tests/test_force_legacy_reporting_only.py` asserts the plan branch remains `legacy_preview_path` — the flag is reporting-only.\n- **Disproved false-positive path**: Parser hit and test presence suggest liveness, but `runtime.py` never references `force_legacy_seen`, and the runbook states \"The live service does not branch on it anymore.\"\n\n## Reachability Matrix\n\n| Flag | Parser Present | Runtime Reachable | Classification | Alias? |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW | Yes | Yes | live | No |\n| ENABLE_PREVIEW_V2 | Yes | Yes (via alias) | partial | Yes → ENABLE_SHADOW_PREVIEW |\n| PREVIEW_FORCE_LEGACY | Yes | No | dead | No |\nEOF\necho \"flag_audit.md written\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
